{
  "title": "Quick Fix Norwegian Beef Borscht",
  "description": "A simple, comforting Norwegian-inspired borscht dish made with hot beef stock and served with a fluffy egg topping. This sweet and savory recipe is a great quick-fix for a weeknight dinner.",
  "cuisine": "Norwegian",
