      "amount": "4"
    },
    {
      "name": "chopped fresh dill",
      "amount": "1 tablespoon"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Whisk together the flour and butter to make a roux.",
    "Add the beef stock to the roux and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat and add the beets, carrots, onion, sugar, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Simmer for 20 minutes or until the beets are tender.",
    "In a separate bowl, whisk together the eggs and a splash of hot water.",
    "Pour the egg mixture over the borscht and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh dill.",
    "Optional: add a dollop of sour cream or crème fraîche on top of each serving."
